# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Host canonicalisation — one origin only: https://incr-ediblecupcakes.com
# Google still has http://www.incr-ediblecupcakes.com/ URLs in its index
# (they are the site's top pages by impressions), so these must be explicit.
# `!` forces the rule even when a matching file exists.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
http://www.incr-ediblecupcakes.com/*   https://incr-ediblecupcakes.com/:splat  301!
https://www.incr-ediblecupcakes.com/*  https://incr-ediblecupcakes.com/:splat  301!
http://incr-ediblecupcakes.com/*       https://incr-ediblecupcakes.com/:splat  301!

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Legacy routes from the pre-Astro (Bolt/Vite SPA) version of the site.
# /flavors is still indexed and is the single highest-impression URL in GSC,
# but the route no longer exists — it was returning 404 and leaking that traffic.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/flavors        /recipes      301
/flavors/*      /recipes      301

